        "id": "867b787f-a487-49ea-ac2f-8705d161237c",
        "content": "<speak>In order to request a C D T eff eh one eleven Certificate of Use Tax Clearance, please submit a Use Tax Clearance Request, at online services dot C D T eff eh dot C eh dot G O V.  Under the Limited Access Functions heading, click the “Request Use Tax Clearance for DMV/HCD”. From there, you can upload any supporting documents.  For additional information regarding the types of documentation required, please refer to Publication 52, also available at the C D T eff eh website. To repeat this message, press 8. To return to the Consumer Use Tax Main Menu, press 9. To speak with a customer service representative, press zero.</speak>",
